<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period February 17-23 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		 Feb 17-23    Feb 19-25	TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    468,534.2	 n/a</p>
<p> Production	 1,424.4	 n/a     1,088,232.7	 n/a</p>
<p> Shipment	  25,091.1	 n/a	 802,110.8	 n/a</p>
<p> Home Market	  400.2	 n/a	  11,102.4	 n/a</p>
<p> Stocks/close   444,467.3	 n/a</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
